    "body": "In principle a user class could override `BaseExceptionGroup.split` and therefore we shouldn't trust the format of the output of it (i.e. a proper check is better than an assert).\r\n\r\nException messages are taken from the CPython implementation.\r\n\r\nAlso simplify call by using existing utility code.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-26T05:10:34Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7854#discussion_r3650159082"
