            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "BTW, according to the Unicode formatting code in CPython, `\"%.0s\"` should also work, although it might actually end up doing a tiny bit more work than less. And I can't say how other implementations handle it. Probably better to stick with `\"%.1s\"` instead.",
            "commit_id": "189ca4d04866f1347149d92099c86a9484985646",
