                    "email": "dw-git@d-woods.co.uk",
                    "name": "da-woods"
                },
                "message": "Improve error handling in __Pyx_ExceptionGroupMatch\n\nIn principle a user class could override `BaseExceptionGroup.split`\nand therefore we shouldn't trust the format of the output of it\n(i.e. a proper check is better than an assert).\n\nException messages are taken from the CPython implementation.\n\nAlso simplify call by using existing utility code.",
